OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fcloudy start but soon becoming windy
OL,7,Fwith cloud, rain and some hill snow
OL,8,Fspreading north through the evening,
OL,9,Fturning heavy at times, and persisting
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy and windy in the
OL,13,Fmorning with rain turning heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes. Wind easing through the
OL,15,Fafternoon and a few drier spells may
OL,16,Fdevelop in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
