OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FThrough to mid-Thursday staying rather
OL,7,Fcloudy with showers or longer periods
OL,8,Fof rain. Turning dry with bright
OL,9,Fspells later Thursday. Mostly dry with
OL,10,Fbright spells Friday, some showers
OL,11,Feast. Chilly.
